## 🔐 User Roles

1. **Admin**
   - Full system access
   - Can access dashboard
   - Can manage users and listings
   - Can view system logs and analytics

2. **Farmer**
   - Can register and login
   - Can post product listings
   - Can manage their listings
   - Can view marketplace

3. **Buyer**
   - Can register and login
   - Can browse listings
   - Can view seller details
   - Can search products

## 📊 Database Models

### UserProfile
- Links to Django User model
- Stores role (farmer/buyer/admin)
- Phone number and address
- Village/town information
- Profile picture
- Verification status

### ProduceListing
- Title and description
- Price and quantity
- Image upload
- Origin village and target town
- Seller (ForeignKey to User)
- Availability status
- Timestamp

### SystemLog
- Tracks all system activities
- Log types: login, signup, listing_created, etc.
- User reference
- IP address
- Timestamp

### SystemMetrics
- Total users count
- Active listings count
- System performance metrics
- Active users count
- Timestamp

### Notification
- Title and message
- Priority level
- Read/unread status
- Target user
- Timestamp

